[gd_scene format=3]

; The Narthex (slice room 1, the start): the porch of the drowned cathedral, where the pilgrim wakes. Calm:
; a shrine to rest at (save point), a Lamplighter that comes to meet the pilgrim, a fallen column to hop.
; The arcade behind opens onto the cathedral skyline. East, a low doorway into the Drowned Hall.

